    "description": "Rewards for Steam achievements (Mission Impossible). Keys are the game's achievement names (identical to the Steam API names).",
    "how_it_works": "When an achievement is newly unlocked, one random reward item is picked from the enabled reward items of its quest_type in items_as_reward (GearLookup.json): daily = small rewards, weekly = medium rewards, monthly = best rewards. The amount follows the reward amount of the picked entry and the difficulty setting.",
    "quest_types": "daily | weekly | monthly",
    "how_to_customize": "Change quest_type to give an achievement smaller or better rewards, or set enabled to false to give no reward for it. Achievements that are not listed here (e.g. Wintermute story achievements) give no reward."
